{"ref":"BDB, עָקַר","hw":"עָקַר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עָקַר</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. denom. pluck</strong> or <strong>root up</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַעֲקוֹר</span> c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.2\">Ec 3:2</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָטַע</span>).<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶקְרוֹן תֵּעָקֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:4\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.4\">Zp 2:4</a> (word-play).","next":"BDB, עִקֵּר","prev":"BDB, עֵ֫קֶר"}